#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "To create a \"share to %(site)s\" button, create an element which has `onclick=\"window.location.href='https://ruqqus.com/submit?url='+window.location.href\"`"
msgstr "For at oprette en \"del til %(site)s\" knappen, skal du oprette et element, der har `onclick=\"window.location.href='https://ruqqus.com/submit?url='+window.location.href\"`"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "To help protect user privacy and safety, %(site)s forces HTTPS on all assets uploaded and submitted to %(site)s. This includes automatic conversion of all \"http://\" schemas into \"https://\"."
msgstr "For at beskytte brugerens privatliv og sikkerhed, %(site)s styrker HTTPS på alle aktiver uploadet og sendt til %(site)s. Dette omfatter automatisk konvertering af alle \"http://\" skemaer til\" https://\"."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "To indicate the presence of a %(site)s-powered embed of content from %(site)s."
msgstr "For at angive tilstedeværelsen af en %(site)s -drevet indkapsling af indhold fra %(site)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "To link to %(site)s, enable sharing to %(site)s, or refer to your presence on %(site)s."
msgstr "For at linke til %(site)s, aktivere deling til %(site)s, eller henvise til din tilstedeværelse på %(site)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "To request ruqqus API keys, visit [this page](/help/apps)"
msgstr "For at anmode om ruqqus API nøgler, besøg [denne side] (/help/apps)"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "To search for the words themselves, put them in quotes: <code>\"#gaming\"</code>."
msgstr "For at søge efter ordene selv, sætte dem i citater: <code>\"#gaming\"</code>."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "To use the access token, include the following header in subsequent API requests to %(site)s: `Authorization: Bearer access_token_goes_here`"
msgstr "For at bruge adgang token, omfatte følgende header i efterfølgende API anmodninger til %(site)s: `Authorization: Bearer access_token_goes_here`"

